    "description": "Source: FoResLab SP: 07 Status: completed Type: Lidar Point Cloud Point density: >1000pts/sqm Data format: LAS 1.4 format 7 (.laz) Date of acquisition: December 2025 to March 2026 Short description: lidar pointcloud acquired with DJI Zenmuse L2 sensor on board a DJI M350 RTK drone. Flights were conducted in 80-90m AGL with ~5m/s. Spatial extent: 50x50m plots extent with a 5 meter buffer Final metric table of box-dimension, canopy cover, effective number of layers, foliage height diversity and vertical evenness.",
